<title>GREECE: TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</title>
<headline>TABLE OF GREEK MUTUAL FUND FLOWS, ASSETS.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ionian Bank reported the</p>
<p>following daily and year-to-date changes in the volume of Greek</p>
<p>mutual fund outstanding shares, net assets and net share prices,</p>
<p>as well as total net asset sizes as of May 19.</p>
<p>				    May 19/May 16   May 19/Dec 31, 96</p>
<p>						 (%)		  (%)</p>
<p>NET SHARE PRICES*</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.16		 6.49</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.09		 4.69</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.11		 9.33</p>
<p>  Growth Funds			    1.61		57.22</p>
<p>* Prices include distributed dividends</p>
<p>VOLUME OF SHARES</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.52		30.92</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.52		31.78</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.15		 8.07</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    0.46		19.90</p>
<p>NET ASSETS</p>
<p>  Total market			    0.67		37.59</p>
<p>  Fixed income &amp;money market funds  0.62		36.46</p>
<p>  International funds		   0.28		15.52</p>
<p>  Growth funds			    2.09		84.79</p>
<p>All calculations are based on a performance index of mutual</p>
<p>funds whose base was set to be equal to 100 on December 31,</p>
<p>1991.</p>
<p>NET ASSET SIZES (in drachmas)</p>
<p>  Total market				  5,232,532,823,089</p>
<p>  Fixed income funds			  1,896,197,368,288</p>
<p>  Money market funds			  3,018,817,539,379</p>
<p>  International funds			    90,814,985,260</p>
<p>  Growth funds				    226,702,930,162</p>
<p>--Angelos Kiosklis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
